WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.730
Hey.

00:00.730 --> 00:02.704
If you wanna live your best creative life,

00:02.704 --> 00:03.735
we gotta talk.

00:03.735 --> 00:05.130
Because the artist within can only emerge

00:05.130 --> 00:07.410
if we strip away the armor.

00:07.410 --> 00:09.701
The protection you built to stay safe.

00:09.701 --> 00:11.568
That's what we're doing here, together.

00:11.568 --> 00:14.100
So if you're a person who wakes up

00:14.100 --> 00:15.750
with a weight already in their chest,

00:15.750 --> 00:17.980
if you feel anxiety, you feel things deeply,

00:17.980 --> 00:19.569
and you're a sensitive person.

00:19.569 --> 00:21.920
You try to create stuff, you work,

00:21.920 --> 00:23.471
but nothing seems to scratch the itch

00:23.471 --> 00:24.782
that really fulfills you.

00:24.782 --> 00:27.012
And you feel like there's a gap between

00:27.012 --> 00:28.405
what you imagine to create

00:28.405 --> 00:29.994
and then what gets created.

00:29.994 --> 00:31.862
And that gap is too big.

00:31.862 --> 00:34.092
You know deep down that you're a butterfly,

00:34.092 --> 00:35.990
and you got all this potential.

00:35.990 --> 00:37.632
But everyone around you, including yourself,

00:37.632 --> 00:38.943
still sees a caterpillar.

00:38.943 --> 00:39.974
And that's frustrating.

00:39.974 --> 00:41.925
You feel like your sensitivity is proof

00:41.925 --> 00:43.235
that you're not enough.

00:43.235 --> 00:45.103
That you're weak. That you're different.

00:45.103 --> 00:47.940
And that you can't do ordinary things

00:47.940 --> 00:48.540
without falling apart.

00:48.540 --> 00:49.140
This is me.

00:49.140 --> 00:50.706
Look, I've always been sensitive.

00:50.706 --> 00:52.016
I've always been scared.

00:52.016 --> 00:53.968
And the moment everything changed for me

00:53.968 --> 00:56.393
was when I stopped running away from that.

00:56.393 --> 00:59.097
And that's kind of like a cliche term, right?

00:59.097 --> 01:01.327
But I did my first public speaking event

01:01.327 --> 01:03.752
in front of 15 of my closest friends.

01:03.752 --> 01:05.982
And what I realized there in the room,

01:05.982 --> 01:06.818
along with everybody,

01:06.818 --> 01:08.686
is that we are all artists.

01:08.686 --> 01:10.359
And our shadows are actually here

01:10.359 --> 01:12.226
to help us express that art.

01:12.226 --> 01:13.258
And that's beautiful.

01:13.258 --> 01:14.652
So my sensitivity, my anxiety,

01:14.652 --> 01:16.045
the feelings that I feel,

01:16.045 --> 01:18.749
were the gifts I hadn't learned to use yet.

01:18.749 --> 01:20.896
So your sensitivity is not a wound.

01:20.896 --> 01:22.485
It is not a weakness.

01:22.485 --> 01:24.715
It is a gift that allows your art

01:24.715 --> 01:26.304
to carry depth and meaning.

01:26.304 --> 01:27.976
If you think of a butterfly,

01:27.976 --> 01:29.370
the butterfly is a caterpillar

01:29.370 --> 01:30.959
for a very long time.

01:30.959 --> 01:32.910
But at a certain point, it realizes

01:32.910 --> 01:35.335
that it needs to go through a metamorphosis.

01:35.335 --> 01:36.367
So it does.

01:36.367 --> 01:37.956
And it spreads its wings.

01:37.956 --> 01:39.545
And now it can fly.

01:39.545 --> 01:40.855
Now it is airborne.

01:40.855 --> 01:43.001
But there's a process to do that.

01:43.001 --> 01:44.311
So just imagine it.

01:44.311 --> 01:46.458
You don't wake up with anxiety anymore.

01:46.458 --> 01:47.768
The weight is gone.

01:47.768 --> 01:49.162
You wake up feeling excited,

01:49.162 --> 01:50.834
like the day has pure potential,

01:50.834 --> 01:52.981
pure possibility for what could be created.

01:52.981 --> 01:54.375
What kind of magical things

01:54.375 --> 01:55.685
can we create today?

01:55.685 --> 01:57.552
That's what the creative life is.

01:57.552 --> 01:59.699
You feel proud of what you're creating.

01:59.699 --> 02:02.124
You feel it means so much to you.

02:02.124 --> 02:04.075
And it's not just something you make

02:04.075 --> 02:06.222
or something to further along your business.

02:06.222 --> 02:07.894
It is a true, authentic expression

02:07.894 --> 02:09.205
of who you are.

02:09.205 --> 02:11.351
Your sensitivity is not a weakness anymore.

02:11.351 --> 02:13.497
It's actually the gift that you carry.

02:13.497 --> 02:15.170
The sensitive antenna that you have

02:15.170 --> 02:18.280
that allows you to make great art.

02:18.280 --> 02:18.880
It's what makes your work extraordinary,

02:18.880 --> 02:21.219
and it allows you to live the life

02:21.219 --> 02:23.060
you came here to live.

02:23.060 --> 02:23.660
Not only that,

02:23.660 --> 02:25.317
you're also impacting people in ways

02:25.317 --> 02:26.627
that even surprise you.

02:26.627 --> 02:29.052
Your creativity and your art serves the world.

02:29.052 --> 02:30.725
People genuinely love you for it,

02:30.725 --> 02:32.035
because it heals them.

02:32.035 --> 02:33.707
And all you did was express

02:33.707 --> 02:34.739
your truth authentically.

02:34.739 --> 02:36.133
You're embodying the inner artist

02:36.133 --> 02:38.000
you always knew was in there.

02:38.000 --> 02:40.426
And that is the highest version of yourself.

02:40.426 --> 02:41.819
You feel proud, right now,

02:41.819 --> 02:43.129
in your own skin.

02:43.129 --> 02:44.997
And it feels like coming home.

02:44.997 --> 02:46.670
If this is resonating with you,

02:46.670 --> 02:48.259
how do we do this?

02:48.259 --> 02:50.210
Well, we start with the nervous system

02:50.210 --> 02:51.241
and the self-image.

02:51.241 --> 02:52.830
We start in the body.

02:52.830 --> 02:55.060
We look at what triggers your nervous system,

02:55.060 --> 02:56.928
and we learn to regulate it.

02:56.928 --> 02:59.074
We train your body to feel safe.

02:59.074 --> 03:00.747
And when we can be safe,

03:00.747 --> 03:02.336
our intelligence can have fun.

03:02.336 --> 03:03.646
That's what creativity is.

03:03.646 --> 03:05.876
And we completely change how we see ourselves

03:05.876 --> 03:06.991
by requalifying the thoughts

03:06.991 --> 03:08.664
that have been reinforcing the caterpillar,

03:08.664 --> 03:10.531
the person we don't wanna be.

03:10.531 --> 03:12.483
We improve the meaning behind our shadows,

03:12.483 --> 03:13.598
because things like sensitivity

03:13.598 --> 03:15.610
actually represent your gifts

03:15.610 --> 03:16.210
of creativity and authenticity.

03:16.210 --> 03:17.974
So we get you to see yourself

03:17.974 --> 03:19.368
no longer as the caterpillar,

03:19.368 --> 03:21.319
but as the butterfly you are becoming

03:21.319 --> 03:22.351
in real time.

03:22.351 --> 03:23.745
If you take away anything

03:23.745 --> 03:25.696
from listening to my voice right now,

03:25.696 --> 03:27.090
it's that you need permission,

03:27.090 --> 03:28.400
and you need honesty.

03:28.400 --> 03:30.072
You're gonna feel a pure permission

03:30.072 --> 03:32.024
in your body to go this path,

03:32.024 --> 03:33.891
to live this type of lifestyle.

03:33.891 --> 03:35.843
And the honesty to finally see yourself,

03:35.843 --> 03:38.073
and how much love you have for creativity,

03:38.073 --> 03:39.940
and to create your best work.

03:39.940 --> 03:41.892
And there's gonna be so much meaning

03:41.892 --> 03:43.740
behind this that it's gonna fuel you.

03:43.740 --> 03:46.470
And this is what fuels the artist.

03:46.470 --> 03:48.415
This is how you access the creative fire,

03:48.415 --> 03:49.808
live your best creative life,

03:49.808 --> 03:51.397
and go through the metamorphosis.

03:51.397 --> 03:53.627
So if any part of you felt like

03:53.627 --> 03:55.300
I was talking to you here,

03:55.300 --> 03:57.780
it's because I really am talking

03:57.780 --> 03:58.380
to an older version of me.

03:58.380 --> 04:00.708
I am you, in a way.

04:00.708 --> 04:02.018
Which is so cool.

04:02.018 --> 04:03.050
I see you.

04:03.050 --> 04:04.638
I know what you're carrying.

04:04.638 --> 04:06.840
And I want you to know that there is a plan,

04:06.840 --> 04:09.377
and you don't have to figure

04:09.377 --> 04:10.966
all of this out alone.

04:10.966 --> 04:13.391
So here's what I want you to do.

04:13.391 --> 04:14.144
Scroll down.

04:14.144 --> 04:16.095
Leave me your name and your email,

04:16.095 --> 04:18.047
and send me a voice note back

04:18.047 --> 04:19.636
answering the two questions below.

04:19.636 --> 04:21.225
Just speak from the heart.

04:21.225 --> 04:23.455
Tell me what living your best creative life

04:23.455 --> 04:24.291
actually looks like,

04:24.291 --> 04:26.242
and tell me what's been stopping you

04:26.242 --> 04:27.274
from doing that.

04:27.274 --> 04:29.504
And as soon as I get your message,

04:29.504 --> 04:30.535
I'm gonna respond.

04:30.535 --> 04:32.124
That's my promise to you.

04:32.124 --> 04:34.075
And I just wanna say thank you,

04:34.075 --> 04:35.748
and cheers to at least beginning

04:35.748 --> 04:36.779
this creative life.

04:36.779 --> 04:39.205
Because this is what fuels me so much.

04:39.205 --> 04:41.713
So the fact that I get to help you

04:41.713 --> 04:44.139
with this too, man, this is a gift.

04:44.139 --> 04:45.532
Anyways, thank you for listening,

04:45.532 --> 04:47.400
and we'll be in touch soon.
